title: 'asset-conversion: benchmark AHW with trust-backed pairs'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    The Asset Hub Westend `pallet_asset_conversion` benchmarks only used foreign asset pairs, so
    they never measured the `AssetsHolder` read made for trust-backed assets. Adds
    `TrustBackedAssetPairFactory` to `assets-common` and uses it for Asset Hub Westend.
crates:
- name: assets-common
  bump: minor
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
